  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance of Consulting Engineers for works contracts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Consultant shall provide a detailed Methodology for the execution of the different works on infrastructure foreseen in the project. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 1: Planning and Pre-design Stage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 2: Preliminary Engineering Designs and Freezing Documents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 3: Detail Design Stage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 4: Procurement of Construction Works&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 5: Contract Administration and Supervision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 6: Defects Liability and Post Construction Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The required outputs are :&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Designs and drawings for new construction works completed as per stages 1 to 3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Reports for each stage compiled and submitted as per Section 5 below&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Compilation of all Bills of Quantities for new construction and renovations works completed and submitted for approval&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Tender documents prepared and submitted for the construction phase&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Supervise all renovation and construction works of all the agricultural infrastructure foreseen in the project&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
